                            ],
                            Label: "more_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The restoration tank still runs, whatever the board relabeled it. Set a fossil on the plate and I seal it in; the machine gives back what the sediment kept. One waking per stone - I do not press my luck twice on the same fossil."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Show me what you found."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Kenji - the revival bench",
                    Label: "revive"
                },
