                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The last of the odd ones. Even these the tank will wake."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Kenji - the revival bench",
                    Label: "revive_more2"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Back",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Every fossil is a locked argument the water spent ten thousand years making. The tank listens to the mineral, finds where the life used to be, and fills the gaps - patiently, one cell of guesswork at a time."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "It does not judge which stone is worth waking. A Kabuto and a Tyrunt get the same patience. Old things all deserve that much - the Company would sell them by the gram, but here they get to stand up and walk out."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Kenji - the long game",
                    Label: "fossil_lore"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Back",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_DEFAULT_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "back_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Follow the spray to the strata shelf below the falls. Look for a ring of soft pale gravel - brush slowly and lift what the water hid. Bones and sherds mostly. And, if the water is generous, a fossil for the tank."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Kenji - reading the strata",
                    Label: "dig_directions"
                }
            ]
